{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-samana-miami-2","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"samana-miami-jvt","about":"Miami 2 by Samana Developers is a magnificent residential development located in the Jumeirah Village Triangle neighborhood. The project boasts an ultra-modern architectural design inspired by the sunny city of Miami. This reflects Samana Developers' design philosophy of luxury with comfort. The curved white facade, podium pools, coconut palms planted around and spectacular flamingo artwork are all designed to evoke the feeling of being in Miami. In addition to an upscale designer building that reflects a luxury lifestyle, Miami also offers you the comfort of enjoying the warmth of nature with spacious balconies beautifully complemented by urban gardens. In addition, the complex features a lounge terrace with pool and iconic water cascades, indoor and outdoor gyms, sauna and steam room, a dedicated playground for children and above all, private pools that will give you a sense of privacy and luxury. With its excellent location and world class interiors, the property exudes regality and opulence.The complex has an excellent location with many popular restaurants, dining establishments, spas, schools, medical facilities and hospitals, resorts, theaters, hotels, shopping malls and much more. It is easy to reach Sheikh Mohammed Ben Zayed Street. Thus, the drive to downtown Dubai and Business Bay takes 35 minutes and to Dubai Marina takes 20 minutes. Travel time to Dubai International Airport takes 40 minutes.","price":649000,"title":"Samana Miami 2","bitrix":{"id":495,"pf_id":"are.2.13088","source":null,"project_id":"Samana Miami 2","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Samana Projects","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Samana Developers","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Triangle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1185/